mad-bhāvaṁ so ’dhigacchati\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3944,\"bb\":3469,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/19/b3469/\",\"shadow_value\":\"na – no; anyam – other; guṇebhyaḥ – than the qualities; kartāram – performer; yadā – when; draṣṭā – a seer; anupaśyati – sees properly; guṇebhyaḥ – to the modes of nature; ca – and; param – transcendental; vetti – knows; mat-bhāvam – to My spiritual nature; saḥ – he; adhigacchati – is promoted.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"no\"},{\"word\":\"anyam\",\"translation\":\"other\"},{\"word\":\"guṇebhyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"than the qualities\"},{\"word\":\"kartāram\",\"translation\":\"performer\"},{\"word\":\"yadā\",\"translation\":\"when\"},{\"word\":\"draṣṭā\",\"translation\":\"a seer\"},{\"word\":\"anupaśyati\",\"translation\":\"sees properly\"},{\"word\":\"guṇebhyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"to the modes of nature\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"param\",\"translation\":\"transcendental\"},{\"word\":\"vetti\",\"translation\":\"knows\"},{\"word\":\"mat-bhāvam\",\"translation\":\"to My spiritual nature\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"},{\"word\":\"adhigacchati\",\"translation\":\"is promoted\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3945,\"bb\":3470,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/19/b3470/\",\"body_value\":\"When one properly sees that in all activities no other performer is at work than these modes of nature and he knows the Supreme Lord, who is transcendental to all these modes, he attains My spiritual nature.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3946,\"bb\":3471,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/19/b3471/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\